# Test configuration only, never to be merged: the RK3026 EBC scan buffers
# in fixed roles (the image on the glass in the low half, the image driven
# towards in the high one), so a kernel of this tree can be compared with
# the default, which rotates them. Applied after rk3026_onyx_rc2.config:
#   make rk3026_c67ml_slim_defconfig rk3026_onyx_rc2.config \
#        rk3026_onyx_rc2_ebc_fixed_roles.config
# CONFIG_DRM_RK3026_EBC_ROTATE_BUFFERS is not set
